	(text "Three IMUs on three separate SPI buses, each on its own switchable\nrail. One sensor hanging its bus must not take the other two with it.\n\nWARNING - before dropping any +3V3_IMUn rail, firmware must drive that\nbus's SCK/MOSI/CS low. Interface pins held high with VDDIO off destroy\nthese parts through their ESD diodes (BMP388 datasheet 3.2)."
		(at 20.32 13.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f59da5e1-8406-4cf1-8d6d-13d451422246")
	)
